OL,3,AFarage senior aide filmed suggesting
OL,4,Away to avoid donations law
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigel Farage's senior aide suggested a
OL,7,Fway to get around electoral law to
OL,8,Fsecure a foreign donation of #500,000
OL,9,Ffor Reform UK, according to undercover
OL,10,Ffilming broadcast by Channel 4.
OL,12,FDan Jukes was filmed meeting a man
OL,13,Fposing as the British-based son of a
OL,14,Frich American businessman.
OL,16,FElectoral law sets out that to be a
OL,17,Fpermissible donor to a UK political
OL,18,Fparty you must be a UK registered
OL,19,Fvoter, or a company registered in the
OL,20,FUK.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
