OL,3,AFarage senior aide filmed suggesting
OL,4,Away to avoid donations law
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn this instance, the son would be a
OL,7,Fpermissible donor, his father would not
OL,8,Fbe.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
