OL,3,ALindsay Clancy's lawyer asks judge to
OL,4,Aremove juror from murder trial after
OL,5,Atense exchange
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the judge rejects the request after
OL,8,Fthe prosecution argues, "there's no way
OL,9,Fto determine what the deliberations
OL,10,Fare, who's correct, who's incorrect,
OL,11,Fnor should we attempt to"
OL,13,FJust beforehand, Clancy's lawyer
OL,14,Fslammed down papers during a tense
OL,15,Fdiscussion with the judge - our
OL,16,Freporter was in the room
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
